{
  "title": "马来西亚电话卡：KLIA2领取还是用eSIM",
  "slug": "malaysia-tourist-sim-card",
  "locale": "zh",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "metaDescription": "马来西亚电话卡怎么买？网上预订后在KLIA2或Lalaport BBCC领取，带护照到电信柜台买，或者用eSIM。",
  "featureImage": null,
  "translationOf": {
    "locale": "en",
    "slug": "malaysia-tourist-sim-card"
  },
  "contentBlocks": [
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>游客在马来西亚上网有三种方法。在网上预订Teeko旅游电话卡，到KLIA2或Lalaport BBCC的旅游服务中心领取。在KLIA2的电信柜台买预付马来西亚电话卡，要带护照原件。或者出发前在手机上安装eSIM。想落地前就把套餐定好，就提前预订。想让柜台人员帮你设置，就去柜台买。手机支持eSIM、想一关飞行模式就有网络，就用eSIM。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "重点速览"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>游客在马来西亚买电话卡要带什么？</strong>在电信柜台买，要带护照原件；如果入境需要签证，签证也要带。自2026年2月27日起，护照复印件和照片都不被接受。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>可以在KLIA2领取电话卡吗？</strong>可以。网上预订Teeko旅游电话卡，然后在KLIA2或Bukit Bintang的Lalaport BBCC旅游服务中心出示预订邮件里的二维码。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>KLIA2的电话卡柜台在哪里？</strong>CelcomDigi在入境层（Arrival Level）的公共大厅。U Mobile在Gateway@klia2的Level 2入境区，Gateway@klia2是和航站楼相连的商场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>游客号码可以用多久？</strong>马来西亚电信公司的游客预付号码最长可用90天，之后服务终止。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>手机支持eSIM，还需要实体卡吗？</strong>不需要。出发前就可以安装eSIM。马来西亚电信公司的eSIM同样是预付号码，所以一样要核查护照。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "三种买马来西亚电话卡的方法一览"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\"></th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">Teeko旅游电话卡</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">KLIA2电信柜台</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">eSIM</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">怎么买</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">网上预订，抵达后领取</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">在柜台购买并登记</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">网上购买，安装到手机</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">在哪里</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">KLIA2或Lalaport BBCC旅游服务中心</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">入境层和Gateway@klia2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">任何有Wi-Fi的地方</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">要出示什么</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">预订邮件里的二维码</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">护照原件，需要签证的话加上签证</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">视卖家而定；马来西亚电信公司会核查护照</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">什么时候能上网</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">领取之后</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">柜台登记完成后</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">出发前装好的话，一落地就能用</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">适合</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">短途旅行、落地前就选好套餐</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">想要有人帮忙设置的旅客</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">支持eSIM的手机</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>规定和柜台位置于2026年10月11日核实。各项来源列在下面每一节里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "方法一：预订Teeko旅游电话卡，抵达后领取"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在旅游电话卡页面选好套餐，用电邮登录，选择领取日期。你会收到一封附有验证码和二维码的邮件。到KLIA2的旅游服务中心或Bukit Bintang的Lalaport BBCC旅游服务中心出示，就能领到电话卡。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>共有五个套餐，都由MyTeekoSIM提供：</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">套餐</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">价格</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">天数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">3-day travel SIM data plan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM25</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">3天</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">4-day travel SIM data plan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM28</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">4天</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">5-day travel SIM data plan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM30</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">5天</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">6-day travel SIM data plan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM35</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">6天</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">7-day travel SIM data plan</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM39</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">7天</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>价格和天数以2026年10月11日的页面为准。每个套餐都列明覆盖马来西亚全国的4G/5G网络，包括主要城市和热门旅游景点。插卡即用，只限在马来西亚境内使用。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>预订者须年满18岁，16至18岁需有父母或监护人陪同。行程有变的话，可在个人资料页面的“我的旅游电话卡预订”取消。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在KLIA2落地？在那里领取，找巴士前就有网络。搭新加坡巴士到Lalaport BBCC？在那里领卡；<a href=\"/zh/blog/lalaport-transportation-hub\">Lalaport BBCC交通枢纽指南</a>带你熟悉环境。<a href=\"/zh/travel-sim-malaysia\">比较旅游电话卡套餐，选好领取日期</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "方法二：在KLIA2电信柜台买电话卡"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>马来西亚的电信公司在KLIA2出售预付电话卡，柜台人员会帮你登记和设置。自2026年2月27日起，游客登记规定更严格，排队前先确认要带什么。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "要带什么"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>带上护照原件；如果入境马来西亚需要签证，签证也要带。复印件、照片和扫描件都不被接受。你的姓名、护照号码、签发国家和到期日会被记录。这是马来西亚通讯及多媒体委员会（MCMC）的规定，2026年2月27日起生效（<a href=\"https://mcigroup.my/editors-pick/tourists-beware-prepaid-sim-cards-now-valid-for-only-three-months-in-malaysia/\">MCI Group报道，2026年2月27日</a>）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在柜台，工作人员会用护照阅读器读取你的护照，并进行人脸识别核查（<a href=\"https://www.u.com.my/en/personal/support/self-help/prepaid-registration-guideline\">U Mobile预付卡登记指南</a>，2026年10月11日核实）。有些电信公司还会要求酒店订单或其他住宿证明（<a href=\"https://my.cmlink.com/en/regulation_guide/\">CMLink Malaysia</a>，2026年10月11日核实）。把酒店确认信存在手机里或打印出来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>每家电信公司最多可为一名非马来西亚公民登记两张预付卡（<a href=\"https://www.malaysianwireless.com/2026/01/mcmc-prepaid-sims-per-telco-foreigner-cap/\">MalaysianWireless关于MCMC标准的报道，2026年1月28日</a>）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "柜台在哪里"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<ul><li><strong>CelcomDigi Store KLIA2。</strong>S2-2-1C03A, Arrival Level public concourse, Terminal KLIA2（<a href=\"https://www.celcomdigi.com/store-locator\">CelcomDigi门市查询</a>）。</li><li><strong>U Mobile。</strong>Level 2 Arrivals, Gateway@klia2（<a href=\"https://www.u.com.my/en/personal/support/store-finder\">U Mobile门市查询</a>）。</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>两处都在2026年10月11日核实。入境区和Gateway@klia2还有其他电信公司和手机摊位。套餐和价格常有变动，在柜台比较一下再买。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-arrival-hall\">KLIA2入境大厅指南</a>带你从海关一路走过去。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "游客号码可以用多久"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>游客预付号码最长可用90天，之后电信公司会终止服务（<a href=\"https://my.cmlink.com/en/regulation_guide/\">CMLink Malaysia</a>；<a href=\"https://mcigroup.my/editors-pick/tourists-beware-prepaid-sim-cards-now-valid-for-only-three-months-in-malaysia/\">MCI Group</a>）。一般度假足够用。如果持工作准证或学生准证长住，登记方式不同，请询问电信公司。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>排队入境前还有一件事：出发前先填好马来西亚数字入境卡。<a href=\"/zh/blog/mdac-malaysia\">MDAC指南</a>一步步教你填写。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "方法三：用eSIM"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>eSIM是下载到手机里的SIM卡资料，用来代替塑料卡。如果手机支持，在家装好，落地后开启就行，不用在柜台排队。<a href=\"/zh/blog/what-is-esim\">eSIM入门指南</a>教你怎么查看手机是否支持。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>马来西亚电信公司的eSIM同样是预付号码，所以和柜台一样要登记护照。国际卖家的旅游eSIM有各自的条款。付款前，看清套餐用的是哪个马来西亚网络、能用几天。如果手机不支持eSIM，就预订Teeko旅游电话卡或去柜台买。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "有了网络之后：从KLIA2进城"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>落地后的第一个小时最需要网络：巴士电子票、叫Grab、用地图找酒店都靠它。机场巴士从KLIA2的Level 1交通枢纽出发；<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-bus-station\">KLIA2巴士站指南</a>告诉你怎么下去。巴士到KL Sentral约一小时。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-kl-sentral\">KLIA2到KL Sentral指南</a>把巴士和火车、德士做了比较。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "cta",
      "content": {
        "heading": "订好KLIA2到KL Sentral的巴士",
        "subheading": "比较KLIA2交通枢纽出发的巴士公司和发车时间，车票直接存在手机里。",
        "buttonText": "查看KLIA2到KL Sentral的巴士",
        "url": "https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-kl-sentral?utm_source=teeko&utm_medium=blog&utm_campaign=malaysia_tourist_sim_card&utm_content=zh"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>住在Bukit Bintang？改搭<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-lalaport-bbcc?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=malaysia_tourist_sim_card&amp;utm_content=zh\">KLIA2到Lalaport BBCC的巴士</a>。终点是Bukit Bintang附近的室内交通枢纽，那里的旅游服务中心也是Teeko旅游电话卡的领取点。<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-bukit-bintang\">KLIA2到Bukit Bintang指南</a>讲解最后一段路。回程时，<a href=\"/zh/blog/taxi-to-klia\">搭德士去KLIA指南</a>帮你安排去机场的车。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "常见问题"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "可以在KLIA2买马来西亚电话卡吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>可以，KLIA2能买到马来西亚电话卡。CelcomDigi的门市在入境层公共大厅，U Mobile的门市在Gateway@klia2的Level 2入境区。记得带护照原件。也可以网上预订Teeko旅游电话卡，到KLIA2旅游服务中心领取。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "可以用护照照片登记马来西亚手机卡吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>不可以。马来西亚预付手机卡不能用护照照片或复印件登记。自2026年2月27日起，电信公司要求护照原件；如果入境需要签证，签证也要带。请带护照到柜台。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "游客的马来西亚SIM卡可以用多久？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>马来西亚电信公司的游客预付SIM卡最长有效90天，之后服务终止。如果持其他准证长住，需要重新登记。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "在哪里领取Teeko旅游电话卡？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在KLIA2旅游服务中心或Bukit Bintang的Lalaport BBCC旅游服务中心领取，出示预订邮件里的验证码和二维码。<a href=\"/zh/travel-sim-malaysia\">预订旅游电话卡</a>并选择领取日期。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "Teeko旅游电话卡多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Teeko旅游电话卡3天RM25、4天RM28、5天RM30、6天RM35、7天RM39。在<a href=\"/zh/travel-sim-malaysia\">旅游电话卡页面</a>选一个能覆盖整个行程的套餐。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "可以取消Teeko旅游电话卡预订吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>可以。打开个人资料页面的“我的旅游电话卡预订”，在那里取消。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "总结"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>买马来西亚电话卡：想落地前就定好套餐，就预订Teeko旅游电话卡，在KLIA2或Lalaport BBCC领取。想要有人帮忙设置，就去电信柜台，记得带护照原件。手机支持的话就用eSIM。然后进城：出发前<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/klia2-to-kl-sentral?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=malaysia_tourist_sim_card&amp;utm_content=zh\">在ttklia.com订好KLIA2到KL Sentral的巴士</a>。</p>"
    }
  ]
}
